      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:125bfd270d0745427d8bb6b69c7e51d822692689480c87c4b9142bf3fb1530b3\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:734724998d3338f847c22fb0f34eadb31d54065634e35b39f94b9e583b679c8b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:136e97c819747dbbceadf350d7fb01a80c7313f63af11c5c651b709245aa7143\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:2f26cd4dc348b35c80098d0e7a172ca1024308719f24ec008a5ea727cfc2b3bc\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"d. The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity. Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant:\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":2651,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":2651,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2420:2651:sha256-778faf4d7d0d84cc0e664e40f572fe27b78123e9eca7cb4a31849d00058e3121\",\"quote\":\"(3) Applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11 do not need to submit ID in the new name. However, if the ID has not yet been changed, they must submit their name change documentation.\",\"start\":2420},{\"end\":2529,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2515:2529:sha256-6c8a07dc3647df6d615b51f7705639875f8c137fc794f8e8a13d0d3e153fa641\",\"quote\":\"do not need to\",\"start\":2515},{\"end\":2651,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2420:2651:sha256-778faf4d7d0d84cc0e664e40f572fe27b78123e9eca7cb4a31849d00058e3121\",\"quote\":\"(3) Applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11 do not need to submit ID in the new name. However, if the ID has not yet been changed, they must submit their name change documentation.\",\"start\":2420},{\"end\":1670,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1433:1670:sha256-7fb835ed90fc315e25a5a9fafb4fd8b0f920d83c8e64fd1e2aa3da14a15e5930\",\"quote\":\"d. The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity. Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant:\",\"start\":1433}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:142f9316d658e30cfe85246c54acf3a04f7b5dd57272fac2780f473539afa0fe\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:2f26cd4dc348b35c80098d0e7a172ca1024308719f24ec008a5ea727cfc2b3bc\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"modality_quote\":\"do not need to\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:9ccffcd31eb0dc058b6bf2ef00f09350b274026715087a0dee732bea7147239f\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(3) Applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11 do not need to submit ID in the new name. However, if the ID has not yet been changed, they must submit their name change documentation.\",\"references\":[\"form DS-11\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:d685f26c99356c60888d5abb580e3c22d1abd7fe80a64902d744a7154ae818cc\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(3) Applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11 do not need to submit ID in the new name. However, if the ID has not yet been changed, they must submit their name change documentation.\"],\"scope_text\":\"For applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11.\",\"section_id\":\"fam-names-section-4\",\"start\":2420,\"summary\":\"Applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11 do not need to submit ID in the new name.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
